To get rid of the blue background:
If your version was compiled with the termcap library, and you have a 
termcap file, do a set TERM=ansi-mono instead of ansi-color.  All the colors
still work, but it gives you a nice black background.  Alternatively,
you can modify the ansi-color section of your termcap file.  The point is
that the background is user defineable.  You must muck with the source to
change any others.
